    "speaker": "bristol-manager",
    "text": "Call convened on PV-301: the examination certificate has expired and the public steam demonstration depends on it. Compliance first."
   },
   {
    "speaker": "bristol-compliance",
    "text": "BR-WSE-PV301-2025 expired 2 days ago. Under the Pressure Systems Safety Regulations a pressure system must not be operated after the date its written-scheme examination was due, so PV-301 cannot be steamed for the public until it is re-examined."
   },
   {
    "speaker": "bristol-engineer",
    "text": "PV-301 is cold and isolated at V-501. V-505's lift test is due with the same examination, so one competent-person visit clears both."
   }
  ],
  "resolution": "The public steam demonstration stays blocked; {contactName} ({contactRole}) books the competent person and confirms the cancellation; compliance sends the site engineer the expired certificate for the file.",
  "summary": {
   "headline": "PV-301 certificate expired: steam demo blocked until re-examined",
   "points": [
    "BR-WSE-PV301-2025 expired 2 days ago.",
    "V-505's lift test falls due with the same examination."
   ],
   "decisions": [
    "Keep the public steam demonstration blocked.",
    "Book one competent-person visit for PV-301 and V-505."
   ],
   "actions": [
    {
     "owner": "{contactName}",
     "task": "Book the competent person and confirm the cancellation",
     "due": "this week"
    },
    {
     "owner": "Compliance Officer · Bristol",
     "task": "Email the expired certificate to the site engineer",
     "due": "today"
    }
   ]
