   {
    "speaker": "bristol-compliance",
    "text": "Each poll re-reads every certificate and permit PDF to check expiry dates, even when nothing changed."
   },
   {
    "speaker": "director",
    "text": "I am switching you to a document cache and change subscriptions, with an 8000-token budget per sweep, then rerunning the efficiency eval."
   },
   {
    "speaker": "bristol-compliance",
    "text": "Understood. I will cache documents by content hash and wait on obligation and document changes instead of polling."
   }
  ],
  "summary": {
   "headline": "Director reconfigures Bristol compliance: cache + subscribe",
   "points": [
    "Bristol compliance spent {ratio}x its peers' median tokens per sweep.",
